@LinfishAppcation_HostAddress = http://localhost:5190

@accessToken = 在這裡貼上 POST /api/auth/login 取得的 accessToken

GET {{LinfishAppcation_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{LinfishAppcation_HostAddress}}/api/members/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

